data: {"id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588-thinking-parallel_evidence-1073", "run_id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 修正后工具调用结果说明\n\n1.  **Logging (Query Pod Logs)**: 失败。\n    *   **错误**: `elasticsearch_error`。底层 Elasticsearch 集群的 `observability` Pod 无法创建执行容器（`pods/exec`），因为 `system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager` 在 `monitor` 命名空间中没有相应权限。\n    *   **结论**: 无法获取 Elasticsearch/Filebeat 格式的日志证据。\n\n2.  **Tracing (Query Pod Tracing)**: 结果为空 (`coverage: empty`)。\n    *   **原因**: 目标 Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 当前没有分配 Pod IP (`pod_ip is empty`)。这直接印证了该 Pod 仍处于 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，尚未进入 `Running` 状态，因此 DeepFlo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788418329651, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588", "seq": 1074, "ts_ms": 1788418335102, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 47.373, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3f0f1f8a8b6e4588-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "c1da03d2f100e14e22a85f6a5231ae0e1fa0bc5ddc3e3fe11fae30077701dbef", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "8fc1d81eca0c2e270f2d2f5023f4cac24d59c1649d23d5caf2cd921cdbd840f2"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588", "seq": 1075, "ts_ms": 1788418335102, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3f0f1f8a8b6e4588", "seq": 1076, "ts_ms": 1788418345882, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.78, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1978, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `failedmount` (fact-78c441803482) | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接揭示挂载失败的根本原因：引用的 ConfigMap 不存在 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `failedmount` (fact-50830607ceb6) | `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition` | 证实挂载阻塞导致容器无法进入运行状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` (fact-da7166371292) | `Ready=False` (`reason=ContainersNotReady`, `message=containers with unready status: [app]`) | 反映容器因挂载依赖未满足而卡在非就绪状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `waiting_reason` (fact-2588325d1e5c) | `ContainerCreating` | 明确当前容器生命周期处于等待依赖准备阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-e0234cc817db) | `1` (labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立确认应用容器当前等待原因 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu` (fact-714434ede6c9) | `5m` | 排除低 CPU 请求导致调度或启动延迟的可能性 |\n| 7 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` (fact-6b6a17fca2b3) | `8Mi` | 排除低内存请求导致调度或启动延迟的可能性 |\n\n证据链表明：指标（#5）与容器状态（#3）均显示容器处于 Waiting/Created 阶段，K8s 事件（#1, #2）给出了具体的等待原因：挂载卷 `input` 失败，因为所需的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。资源配置（#6, #7）显示请求量极低，排除了资源不足导致的调度或启动延迟。日志与追踪工具因容器未启动而无数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 卷 'input' 挂载配置失败 → 容器 'app' 卡在 ContainerCreating → Pod 持续处于 Pending 且应用不可访问\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 规范中声明挂载的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 'aiops-case-03' 中不存在。**\n\n事实证据支撑（#1, #2）明确显示 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。这一错误直接导致 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#3, #4, #5），并阻止了容器的就绪状态（#3）。由于挂载操作在容器启动阶段阻塞，容器物理上无法运行，因此日志与追踪数据（#6, #7）在此场景下不适用且无法收集。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `failedmount` (fact-78c441803482) | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接揭示挂载失败的根本原因：引用的 ConfigMap 不存在 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `failedmount` (fact-50830607ceb6) | `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition` | 证实挂载阻塞导致容器无法进入运行状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` (fact-da7166371292) | `Ready=False` (`reason=ContainersNotReady`, `message=containers with unready status: [app]`) | 反映容器因挂载依赖未满足而卡在非就绪状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `waiting_reason` (fact-2588325d1e5c) | `ContainerCreating` | 明确当前容器生命周期处于等待依赖准备阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-e0234cc817db) | `1` (labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立确认应用容器当前等待原因 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.cpu` (fact-714434ede6c9) | `5m` | 排除低 CPU 请求导致调度或启动延迟的可能性 |\n| 7 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` (fact-6b6a17fca2b3) | `8Mi` | 排除低内存请求导致调度或启动延迟的可能性 |\n\n证据链表明：指标（#5）与容器状态（#3）均显示容器处于 Waiting/Created 阶段，K8s 事件（#1, #2）给出了具体的等待原因：挂载卷 `input` 失败，因为所需的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。资源配置（#6, #7）显示请求量极低，排除了资源不足导致的调度或启动延迟。日志与追踪工具因容器未启动而无数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 卷 'input' 挂载配置失败 → 容器 'app' 卡在 ContainerCreating → Pod 持续处于 Pending 且应用不可访问\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 规范中声明挂载的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 'aiops-case-03' 中不存在。**\n\n事实证据支撑（#1, #2）明确显示 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。这一错误直接导致 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#3, #4, #5），并阻止了容器的就绪状态（#3）。由于挂载操作在容器启动阶段阻塞，容器物理上无法运行，因此日志与追踪数据（#6, #7）在此场景下不适用且无法收集。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

